('127.889.d.10.A',3,'A student sorts engine-area fires into electrical, structural and fuel or oil-fed fires. She is:','["identifying types of fires such as electrical, structural and petroleum-based fires", "describing tires", "describing seats", "ignoring fires"]'::jsonb,0,'Fire types.','original'),
