('127.889.d.10.B',3,'A student explains how a thermal switch and a continuous loop send a signal to the cockpit fire light. She is:','["ignoring detection", "describing tires", "identifying the components and explaining the basic operation of fire detection warning systems", "describing seats"]'::jsonb,2,'Detection systems.','original'),
