('127.889.d.10.F',3,'A technician is warned that a discharge cartridge (squib) can fire if handled with the wrong tool or with power on. She is researching:','["no risks", "tire brands", "the risks of container discharge cartridges", "paint choices"]'::jsonb,2,'Squib risk.','original'),
